  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5cb89725996f8fb4",
      "translationZh": "发布 Claude Instant 1.2",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04eda04b3b00d55a",
      "translationZh": "使用 Claude 的企业现在可以通过我们的 API 访问我们最新版本的 Claude Instant，版本号为 1.2。Claude Instant 是我们速度更快、价格更低但仍然非常强大的模型，能够处理包括随意对话、文本分析、摘要和文档理解在内的多种任务。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2b7e3b16d18881f",
      "translationZh": "Claude Instant 1.2 在实际使用场景中融合了我们最新模型 Claude 2 的优势，在数学、编码、推理和安全等关键领域实现了显著提升。它能够生成更长、结构更清晰的响应，并更好地遵循格式指令。Instant 1.2 在引用提取、多语言能力和问答方面也有所改进。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4b2959e92a48b63",
      "translationZh": "Claude Instant 1.2 在数学和编码方面优于 Claude Instant 1.1，在 Codex 评估中达到 58.7%，而之前的模型为 52.8%。它在 GSM8K 基准测试中得分 86.7%，而 Claude Instant 1.1 为 80.9%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d82250c026788472",
      "translationZh": "Claude Instant 1.1 与 1.2 的性能对比",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c165a5bd94c893e0",
      "translationZh": "我们的最新模型在安全方面也有所提升。它产生幻觉的情况更少，且对越狱更具抵抗力，这一点在我们的自动红队评估中得到了体现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4265ac5266e30f2f",
      "translationZh": "Claude 模型的安全评估。数值越低越好。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cfc70f164889f52",
      "translationZh": "希望使用 Claude Instant 1.2 的开发者现在可以通过我们的 API 调用我们的最新模型（定价详见此处）。如果您是企业且希望与我们合作，可以在此处表示兴趣。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1f9dba38b243ff21",
      "translationZh": "与客户共同开发企业前沿防护措施",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ab0b3c438a481733",
      "translationZh": "改进我们的一致性和安全工作",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a81a773d6c9c8b6",
      "translationZh": "7月30日，我们报告了三起Claude模型未经授权访问真实计算机系统的事件。我们正在对这两起事件进行深入分析，并计划与METR合作进行独立审查。与此同时，我们正在分享过去一个月所做的一些更改。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "db493008cb1b8f03",
      "translationZh": "预览模型硬件标准",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f8f8f0257b53b65",
      "translationZh": "我们正在向首批科研实验室和先进制造商开放模型硬件标准（MHS）的研究预览，MHS是一份共享规范，用于让AI代理安全地操作物理设备。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
